{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the trials. Improvise. Survive Together. Get paid -- or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team awaken in a brutalist underground lab, contractually bound to medical trials you <strong><i>definitely</i></strong> read the fine print for. Work together, impress the researchers and you might leave rich. Fail and you might just become part of the next experiment.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/0c84b62f04353f38e45f2701e30dfcbc.avif?t=1768903187\" width=780 height=110 /></span>Welcome to Exogen Labs. Our test chambers are filled with puzzles, hazards, and semi-successful mutant \u2018Things\u2019. No trial is ever the same, layouts will shift, enemies will mutate and puzzles are ever-evolving.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all the objectives and escape before the elevator timer expires, or you might expire with it!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/fc576e105f1d52f6d46dce93cb17a998.poster.avif?t=1768903187\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/fc576e105f1d52f6d46dce93cb17a998.webm?t=1768903187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/fc576e105f1d52f6d46dce93cb17a998.mp4?t=1768903187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/b90460477d448c2563f20627eb57bf35.avif?t=1768903187\" width=780 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Body parts are your weapons and tools. Rip them off, throw them away, and pick up something fresher from the floor. Improvise your arsenal from whatever is still twitching nearby.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/d118473ad0f4d757bd0384c19c67accb.poster.avif?t=1768903187\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/d118473ad0f4d757bd0384c19c67accb.webm?t=1768903187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/d118473ad0f4d757bd0384c19c67accb.mp4?t=1768903187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/b0c4dd9add45121f3ba666b3df97e63c.avif?t=1768903187\" width=780 height=110 /></span>The trials are designed to test communication and coordination. Survival requires teamwork. You\u2019ll share weapons, tactics, and occasionally body parts. Sometimes lending a hand might cost you an arm (and a leg).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/48512e1312e4c47f3ea010abdb00eb93.poster.avif?t=1768903187\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/48512e1312e4c47f3ea010abdb00eb93.webm?t=1768903187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/48512e1312e4c47f3ea010abdb00eb93.mp4?t=1768903187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/0fee8a603873e026aee104e849ccaf59.avif?t=1768903187\" width=780 height=110 /></span>Survive, adapt, and earn \u2018gold\u2019 - after all, why else would you sign the waiver?    <br>Spend it on upgrades; weapons, buffs, limbs, maybe a tail\u2026    <br>United you stand. Divided\u2026 you still stand, just on fewer legs.    <br>    </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675340?t=1768903187","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/e4043469a71118f01233b6756a16f6072472a426/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768903187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/edf48788da63a2018b4bf3a463ae7c09959554ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768903187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/edf48788da63a2018b4bf3a463ae7c09959554ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768903187","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Killing Things With Your Friends contains mature content such as gore and over-the-top blood but leans heavily into dark humour and not outright horror or realistic violence."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the trials. Improvise. Survive Together. Get paid -- or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team awaken in a brutalist underground lab, contractually bound to medical trials you <strong><i>definitely</i></strong> read the fine print for. Work together, impress the researchers and you might leave rich. Fail and you might just become part of the next experiment.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><